### Firmware builds contract (Phase 6) — parity with the previous stack, adapted
#
# Adaptations vs the initial POC :
# - chemins sans slash terminal (convention.md) ;
# - org scoping (D2): X-Org-Id required, `org_id` in the records instead
#   of the previous stack's `user` ;
# - plus de champs k8s/Argo (`backend`, `job_name`, `argo_wf_job_name`) —
#   la réponse de création expose `build_id` + `status` ;
# - canonical lowercase phases: queued (new — the previous stack had no
#   queued state, submit was synchronous) | running (Running) | succeeded
#   (Succeeded) | failed (Failed) ; Deleted dropped (no more k8s job) ;
# - build-records paginé (D14, enveloppe {count,next,previous,results}) ;
# - corps strict (2026-10-09) : tout champ inconnu est refusé (plus de
#   `ws_ssl`, `wifi_ssid`/`wifi_password`, `predefined_device_name` — le
#   modèle est celui du device ; le firmware est toujours wss) ;
# - erreurs forme héritée {"error": "..."} ; validation champ {"<champ>": "..."}.
#
# Runtime secrets: the queue only carries the WiFi entry's vault reference
# and the host; the worker decrypts the WiFi password, reads the token and
# the Noise key back from the database, and issues the client certificate.

@host = http://localhost:5150
@token = $PNEX_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Lancer un build — 201 ; erreurs : 400 validation/modèle, 404 device,
### 403 quota devices, 429 intervalle min (dernier build RÉUSSI de l'org).
# (ForegroundBlocking en test / BackgroundQueue via --server-and-worker.)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/build-firmware
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Org-Id: 4

# WiFi : une entrée du référentiel de l'org (`wifi_credential_id`) — le mot
# de passe reste dans le coffre et le worker le déchiffre (secrets.md S6).
{
  "wifi_credential_id": 7,
  "device_id": "capteur-jardin",
  "pnex_host": "dev1.pnex.io"
}

# → 201
# {
#   "build_id": 12,
#   "status": "queued",
#   "message": "Firmware build job created successfully"
# }

### Records de l'org — paginés D14, filtres device_id (exact) et
### build_phase=queued|running|succeeded|failed ; tri id DESC.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/build-records?limit=10&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Org-Id: 4

### Télécharger le binaire du dernier build réussi du device — proxy des
### octets (pas d'URL présignée), attachment {device_id}-firmware.bin ;
### 404 si aucun build réussi / artefact absent.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/download/firmware/capteur-jardin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Org-Id: 4
